# PLAN-852 T-05: scalar session lifecycle on the SAME frozen B09 source
# (fact). Four real observations per the 827 V-07 session shape:
#   warm (fresh session), hot (new worker, warm store — a hit is never a
#   cached PASS: AV really executes), body edit (fact(5) -> fact(6), the
#   exactly-once literal replacement, judged against the NEW value), and
#   cross-process persistence of the EDIT (a NEW check pair replays the
#   same content edit in fresh workers over the warm store — the store is
#   CONTENT-addressed, so this is the honest edit-persistence observation;
#   a no-edit check would legitimately rerun the ORIGINAL content). The mn
#   face adds the AC-side edit/restart sequence (restart splits into a REAL
#   new worker process; the store on disk is the only carried state).
# Native online HMR (I08) is NOT claimed here — that needs the native
# loader capability package.

```test-case
case {
  schema: "autolang.case/2"
  id: "ace.m1.session.av"
  tags: ["ace-m1", "lifecycle", "av"]
  links: ["PLAN-852"]
  source: { file: "src/B09.at", syntax: "auto", path: "main.at" }
  entry: { mode: "program" }
  checks: [
    { id: "warm-run", adapter: "probe", action: "run",
      options: {
        recipe: "ac-av/core-run-v1",
        av: { entry: "d_main", session: "ace-m1-b09" },
        steps: [ { op: "run" } ]
      },
      expect: { completion: "success", exit: 120 } },
    { id: "hot-run", adapter: "probe", action: "run",
      options: {
        recipe: "ac-av/core-run-v1",
        av: { entry: "d_main", session: "ace-m1-b09" },
        steps: [ { op: "run" } ]
      },
      expect: { completion: "success", exit: 120 } },
    { id: "body-edit-run", adapter: "probe", action: "run",
      options: {
        recipe: "ac-av/core-run-v1",
        av: { entry: "d_main", session: "ace-m1-b09" },
        steps: [
          { op: "edit-source", from: "fact(5)", to: "fact(6)" },
          { op: "run" }
        ]
      },
      expect: { completion: "success", exit: 720 } },
    { id: "edit-persist-across-workers", adapter: "probe", action: "run",
      options: {
        recipe: "ac-av/core-run-v1",
        av: { entry: "d_main", session: "ace-m1-b09" },
        steps: [
          { op: "edit-source", from: "fact(5)", to: "fact(6)" },
          { op: "run" }
        ]
      },
      expect: { completion: "success", exit: 720 } }
  ]
}
```

